rks and shopping centers are where I enjoy family time. I live near Andheri and arrive promptly. Traffic snarls and noise, though, need rapid handling.\n\n— Kalpesh Shah, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of New Lata Apartment\n\n## Property Registration Data [...] ### What configurations are available at New Lata Apartment?\n\nNew Lata Apartment offers 1 BHK Flats catering to different space and budget requirements.\n\n### Can I visit the actual flat at New Lata Apartment before buying?\n\nYes, since New Lata Apartment is a Ready to Move project in Goregaon West, buyers can arrange site visits and inspect the actual apartment before finalizing the deal.","score":0.8055255,"raw_content":null,"id":"06f7aa-01"},{"url":"https://www.pranavconstructions.com/new-lata-apartments","title":"New Lata Apartments C.H.S.L - Delivered Residential Projects by PCPL","content":"### Project Status\n\nCompleted\n\n### Achievements\n\nHome Icon\n\n#### Delivered:15 Months Earlier of Committed Time\n\nCommitted Time: 30 Months\n\nDelivery Time: 15 Months\n\nNew Lata Apartments C.H.S.L is not just a concept anymore as we have worked hard to achieve the nearest semblance to your enchanted home. New Lata Apartments C.H.S.L with a constructed area of about 22,650 sq.ft.is a re- development project at Gajanan Colony Road, Goregaon West, Mumbai that focuses on providing you with all the amenities which will help you enjoy life to the fullest no matter the age group. Fitness center, society office are just a few of our services which we have to offer.\n\n## Indoor & Outdoor Amenities\n\nFitness Center Icon\n\nFitness Center\n\nSociety Office Icon\n\nSociety Office\n\nRain Water Harvesting Icon [...] Society Office\n\nRain Water Harvesting Icon\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\nCCTV Camera Icon\n\nCCTV Cameras\n\nSmart Elevators Icon\n\nSmart Elevators\n\nMechanise Stack Parking\n\nMechanise Stack Parking\n\n## Floor Plan\n\nLata Floor Plan\n\n## Gallery\n\nNew Lata Apartment\nNew Lata Apartment 2\n\n## Loca